  <div class="it">Normal school day</div>
  <div class="rec"><span class="tg weekly">Every Mon</span> Show & Tell</div></div>

  <div class="blk family"><div class="bh"><div class="bi">📋</div><div><div class="bn">Family</div></div><span class="tg admin">Prep</span></div>
  <div class="it">🧳 <strong>Start packing for KZN trip</strong> (Thu departure!)</div>
  <div class="it">📋 Brief Ingrid & John on kids' schedule Thu–Sun</div></div>

  <div class="rbox red"><div class="lb">🔴 Action Required</div><ul>
  <li><strong>Emma:</strong> Arrive early for Instrument Open Day 7:15am + PE kit</li>
  <li><strong>Luke:</strong> Hockey kit for trials 15:30</li>
  <li><strong>KZN prep:</strong> Start packing, print schedule for Ingrid & John</li></ul></div>

  <div class="rbox yel"><div class="lb">💡 Think Ahead → Tuesday</div><ul>
  <li>Emma: English Spelling list 16 + Art Theory + Science test</li>
  <li>Luke: Hockey Trials Rd 3 at 14:30</li>
  <li>Gracie: P/T Feedback Meetings 1pm + Gymnastics + Library bag</li></ul></div>
</div>
<div class="ft">FOX FAMILY · STELLENBOSCH</div>
</div>

